      "ZZT083p142 has a genuine Sun Xiu anchor at s0354 but also one demonstrably foreign English Xiu occurrence m0796 and foreign s0386 evidence within name claim c0283. s0385–s0386 concern Li Xiang 李庠 under Zhao Xin 廞, existing p150; mistranslated Li Xiu/Xiu is not Sun Xiu. This proposal identifies p142 by its genuine anchor and does not certify its false occurrence or mixed evidence. Explicit source/ownership QA and staging-boundary disclosure remain for host and exact peer; no correction is silently applied.",
